{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "insurance-policy-management-v1",
    "name": "Insurance Policy Management System API",
    "description": "Comprehensive Postman collection for the Insurance Policy Management API.\n\n### Features Covered:\n- **Bulk CSV / XLSX Data Ingestion** via isolated worker threads.\n- **Universal Pagination**: `page` & `limit` query parameters with metadata (`total`, `page`, `limit`, `totalPages`, `hasNextPage`, `hasPrevPage`).\n- **Bypass Pagination (`all=true`)**: Fetch the complete dataset in one request without pagination.\n- **Date Range Filtering**: `startDate` & `endDate` (`YYYY-MM-DD`).\n- **Keyword Search**: `search` / `q` case-insensitive regex search.\n- **User Summary Aggregation Pipeline**.\n- **Category & Carrier Directory Services**.\n- **Scheduled Messages** with distributed atomic lock claims.\n- **Health Monitoring & System Diagnostics**.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
